'''Mighty Morta-Loncha''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

